    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="24">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 24</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ we lærað þæt man wið fulne galscipe ⁊ wið unrihthǽmed ⁊ wið æghwylce ǽwbryce warnian georne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we enjoin that foul lasciviousness and illicit unions and every [kind of] adultery be zealously abhorred.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And we lærað, þæt man wið fúlne galscipe ⁊ wið unrihthæmed ⁊ wið æghwylcne æwbryce warnige symle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
